2026-05-10 21:24:08,767 - INFO - 
2026-05-10 21:24:08,767 - INFO - 4. **Medical Recognition**: Major health organizations, including the American Medical Association (AMA) and the World Health Organization (WHO), recognize addiction as a disease. This recognition is based on extensive research and clinical evidence.
2026-05-10 21:24:08,767 - INFO - 
