2026-05-10 21:32:33,078 - INFO - Neither side is entirely right or wrong. The impact of smartphones on life is highly dependent on how they are used. When used responsibly, smartphones can significantly improve quality of life. However, when used excessively or inappropriately, they can have negative consequences.
