2026-05-10 22:02:05,247 - INFO - - **Virtual Tools and Practices:** Many companies have developed sophisticated virtual tools and practices to maintain and even enhance social cohesion and organizational culture. Regular virtual meetings, team-building activities, and social events can help employees feel connected.
